msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Вновь...?"

#: search:search_913C6C5B_DE65_459D_8148_136B8DAAABE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3ce9bd96dcc4811902f9f8948e8713580554d68b113631fbd66813a905a847a
