msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ты сказала... ⟪k:1⟫что ждала меня..."

#: search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 589d2960bded8605b3c38b432ddceacac44ebc0414a1451a20d95b56e214e66d
