#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b739a850611c3726bd864a269f93abd99f86ebff91e945218879091748a2755
